  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zambia - Provincial Water Supplies Project</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Zambie - Projet d&apos;approvisionnement en eau des provinces</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project consists of the following works KAFOUE: Duplication of the sewerage treatment works (STW) MONZE : Raising level of storage dam, augmentation of capacity of water treatment works, treated water mains, and high level storage. CHOMA : Refurbishment of treatment works, and augmentation of raw water pumps, and rising mains. KALOMO: Addition to pump house and raw water mains. LIVINGSTONE : New raw water pump house, extendtion of treatment palnt and improvements to distribution. Sewerage Oxidation Ponds, with inlet and outlet to the Zambezi.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR"></narrative>
  </description>
